      ],
      "devanagari": "पूर्वं प्रतिज्ञा विदिता वीर्यशुल्का ममात्मजा |\nराजानश्च कृतामर्षा निर्वीर्या विमुखीकृताः",
      "iast": "pūrvam pratijñā viditā vīrya śulkā mama ātmajā |\nrājānaḥ ca kṛta amarṣā nir.hvīryā vimukhī kṛtāḥ",
      "translation": "\" 'Well-known is the solemn promise of mine that my daughter Seetha is a bounty for bravery... also well-know is that the kings who came to lift the bow turned out as gutless kings, and then they turned out as rancorous kings at me, and it is also well-known that I turned them back with my guts...",
