    {
      "id": "1.68.9",
      "label": "1.68.9",
      "numbers": [
        9
      ],
      "devanagari": "तच्च रत्नं धनुर्दिव्यं मध्ये भग्नं महात्मना |\nरामेण हि महाबाहो महत्यां जनसंसदि",
      "iast": "tat ca ratnam dhanur divyam madhye bhagnam mahātmanā |\nrāmeṇa hi mahābāho mahatyām jana saṃsadi",
      "translation": "\" 'Also, oh, highly dextrous king Dasharatha, noble souled Rama wrecked that divine bow, which is a gem of a bow among bows, at its central point before a grand assembly of people...",
