    {
      "id": "1.68.10",
      "label": "1.68.10",
      "numbers": [
        10
      ],
      "devanagari": "अस्मै देया मया सीता वीर्यशुल्का महात्मने |\nप्रतिज्ञां तर्तुमिच्छामि तदनुज्ञातुमर्हसि",
      "iast": "asmai deyā mayā sītā vīrya śulkā mahātmane |\npratijñām tartum icchāmi tat anujñātum ar.hhasi",
      "translation": "\" 'Seetha is the bounty for bravery and I shall have to afford her to the noble-souled Rama, as such it will be apt of you to give your consent as I wish to keep up my solemn promise...",
