    {
      "id": "1.68.11",
      "label": "1.68.11",
      "numbers": [
        11
      ],
      "devanagari": "सोपाध्यायो महाराज पुरोहितपुरस्कृतः |\nशीघ्रमागच्छ भद्रं ते द्रष्टुमर्हसि राघवौ",
      "iast": "sa upādhyāyo mahārāja purohita puraskṛtaḥ |\nśīghram āgaccha bhadram te draṣṭum ar.hhasi rāghavau",
      "translation": "\" 'Keeping your royal priest Vashishta and other teachers ahead of you, oh, great emperor, I wish you to come apace, let safe betide you, for it will be apt of you to take a look at your ennobled son Rama, and Lakshmana, too...",
      "notes": [],
