    {
      "id": "1.68.12",
      "label": "1.68.12",
      "numbers": [
        12
      ],
      "devanagari": "प्रतिज्ञां मम राजेन्द्र निर्वर्तयितुमर्हसि |\nपुत्रयोरुभयोरेव प्रीतिं त्वमपि लप्स्यसे",
      "iast": "pratijñām mama rājendra nirvar.htayitum ar.hhasi |\nputrayoḥ ubhayoḥ eva prītim tvam api lapsyase",
      "translation": "\" 'It will be apt of you to make my solemn promise maintainable, and that way you will derive delight on seeing both of your sons...'",
      "notes": [
        "'by the by, you will also derive delight in seeing Seetha, for she is also a hyphenated daughter of yours, <em>sutasca sutā ca tayoḥ eka śeṣaḥ...</em> with another suffix, in-law...'"
