    {
      "id": "1.68.13",
      "label": "1.68.13",
      "numbers": [
        13
      ],
      "devanagari": "एवं विदेहाधिपतिर्मधुरं वाक्यमब्रवीत् |\nविश्वामित्राभ्यनुज्ञातः शतानन्दमते स्थितः",
      "iast": "evam videha adhipatiḥ madhuram vākyam abravīt |\nviśvāmitra abhyanujñātaḥ śatāananda mate sthitaḥ",
      "translation": "\"Thus the sovereign of Videha kingdom said these endearing words, abiding by the counsel of Sage Shataananda, and Sage Vishvamitra is also consentient to the proposal...\" Thus the envoys conveyed the proposal and paused.",
