    {
      "id": "1.68.14",
      "label": "1.68.14",
      "numbers": [
        14
      ],
      "devanagari": "दूतवाक्यं तु तच्छ्रुत्वा राजा परमहर्षितः |\nवसिष्ठं वामदेवं च मंत्रिणश्चैवमब्रवीत्",
      "iast": "dūta vākyam tu tat śrutvā rājā parama harṣitaḥ |\nvasiṣṭham vāmadevam ca mantriṇaḥ ca evam abravīt",
      "translation": "King Dasharatha is highly gladdened on hearing that message from the delegates, and said this way to Vashishta, Vaamadeva, and to his other ministers, as well.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "raajaa",
