          "iast": "vasiṣṭham vāmadevam ca",
          "devanagari": "वसिष्ठं वामदेवं च",
          "meaning": "to Vashishta, to Vaamadeva, also",
          "anvayaIndex": 3,
          "verseIndex": 8
        },
        {
