          "anvayaIndex": 5,
          "verseIndex": 13
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.68.15",
      "label": "1.68.15",
      "numbers": [
        15
      ],
      "devanagari": "गुप्तः कुशिकपुत्रेण कौसल्यानन्दवर्धनः |\nलक्ष्मणेन सह भ्रात्रा विदेहेषु वसत्यसौ",
      "iast": "guptaḥ kuśika putreṇa kausalya ānanda vardhanaḥ |\nlakṣmaṇena saha bhrātrā videheṣu vasati asau",
      "translation": "\"This one Rama, the enhancer of Kausalya's rejoice, is stopping over at Videha kingdom along with his brother Lakshmana, and Vishvamitra is taking care of both these boys...",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
